* SWM4-NDP, GAAMP
* separate atom type labels

ioformat extended

read rtf card

! Lone pairs
MASS     1 LPDW      0.00000 H  ! lone pair for water: Note overlap of HOH and SWM6 LPs
! HOH and SWM6 polarizable water models
MASS     2 ODW      15.99940 O  ! water oxygen, HOH
MASS     3 HDW       1.00800 H  ! water hydrogen
MASS     4 DOH2      0.00000 H  ! water Drude

! Wild Drude
MASS    -1 DRUD     0.00000 H
MASS    -1 LP       0.00000 H

! IPE FROM DRUE_RESULTS DELETED LP & DRUD & WATER Parameters
MASS        -1 C2IP     12.010000 C
MASS        -1 HAIP     1.008000  H
MASS        -1 CEIP     12.010000 C
MASS        -1 C3IP     12.010000 C
MASS        -1 HCIP     1.008000  H

! OHR
MASS    -1 OOHR     16.000000  O
MASS    -1 HOHR     1.008000   H
!MASS    -1 LPOH     0.000000   H

! A1
MASS        -1 C2A1     12.010000 C
MASS        -1 HAA1     1.008000  H
MASS        -1 CEA1     12.010000 C
MASS        -1 C3A1     12.010000 C
MASS        -1 H1A1     1.008000  H
MASS        -1 HCA1     1.008000  H
MASS        -1 OHA1     16.000000 O
MASS        -1 HOA1     1.008000  H 
MASS        -1 C30A1    12.010000 C
MASS        -1 HA0A1    1.008000  H


! OFF
MASS        -1 C2OFF     12.010000 C
MASS        -1 HAOFF     1.008000  H
MASS        -1 CEOFF     12.010000 C
MASS        -1 C3OFF     12.010000 C
MASS        -1 HCOFF     1.008000  H
MASS        -1 H1OFF     1.008000  H
MASS        -1 OHOFF     16.000000 O
MASS        -1 HOOFF     1.008000  H 
MASS        -1 C30OFF    12.010000 C
MASS        -1 HA0OFF    1.008000  H
MASS        -1 OOFF      16.000000  O
MASS        -1 HOFF      1.008000   H
MASS        -1 LPOFF     0.000000   H


DEFA FIRS NONE LAST NONE
AUTOGENERATE ANGLES DIHEDRALS DRUDE

